><span begin="1:03.247" end="1:03.417">と</span><span begin="1:03.417" end="1:03.547">分</span><span begin="1:03.547" end="1:03.857">け</span><span begin="1:03.957" end="1:04.247">合</span><span begin="1:04.247" end="1:04.427">う</span><span begin="1:04.427" end="1:05.137">夜</span><span begin="1:05.137" end="1:05.327">な</span><span begin="1:05.327" end="1:05.467">ら</span></p><p begin="1:05.467" end="1:11.797" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:05.467" end="1:05.577">ど</span><span begin="1:05.577" end="1:05.747">こ</span><span begin="1:05.747" end="1:05.927">ま</span><span begin="1:05.927" end="1:06.357">で</span><span begin="1:06.817" end="1:07.977">先</span><span begin="1:07.977" end="1:08.207">が</span><span begin="1:08.207" end="1:08.817">続</span><span begin="1:08.817" end="1:08.937">い</span><span begin="1:08.937" end="1:09.217">て</span><span begin="1:09.217" end="1:10.187">も</span><span begin="1:10.187" end="1:10.427">いい</span><span begin="1:10.427" end="1:11.797">よ</span></p><p begin="1:14.633" end="1:19.323" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:14.633" end="1:14.963">明け</span><span begin="1:14.963" end="1:15.073">る</span><span begin="1:15.073" end="1:15.253">ま</span><span begin="1:15.253" end="1:15.563">で</span><span begin="1:16.993" end="1:17.473">心</span><span begin="1:17.473" end="1:17.603">を</span><span begin="1:17.603" end="1:18.043">預</span><span begin="1:18.043" end="1:18.473">け</span><span begin="1:18.473" end="1:18.633">合</span><span begin="1:18.763" end="1:19.133">おう</span><span begin="1:19.133" end="1:19.323">よ</span></p><p begin="1:19.327" end="1:24.277" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:19.327" end="1:19.607">そ</span><span begin="1:19.607" end="1:19.727">の</span><span begin="1:19.727" end="1:19.857">う</span><span begin="1:19.857" end="1:20.387">ち</span><span begin="1:21.637" end="1:21.897">眠</span><span begin="1:21.897" end="1:22.077">気</span><span begin="1:22.077" end="1:22.267">が</span><span begin="1:22.267" end="1:23.25